<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact the Swipey AI editorial site about factual corrections, privacy, source updates, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, exact statement or asset, reason for the request, and a primary source supporting the correction.</p><h2>Do not send sensitive material</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, private companion chats, identification documents, voice recordings, or intimate images to review a correction.</p><h2>Contact address</h2><p>The intended editorial address is <strong>support@swipeyai.fun</strong>. Mail delivery has not yet been configured, so do not assume messages to this address can be received. A working contact channel will be confirmed here when it is ready.</p></InfoPage>
